        "source_row": 2,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_c6c164c3",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "隐海修会信奉英白拉多，在拉古那的传统中，他们是岁主的人间代理人，负责引导拉古那人，使他们不至于偏离岁主的教诲。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 2,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 3,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_3a364d23",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "隐海修会由「主座」领导，现任主座芬莱克在任期间曾颁布了一系列法令，对艺术创作的题材进行了限制。民众们对这些法令的看法褒贬不一。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 3,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 4,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_ed05857a",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "芬莱克自称为「神启者」，即黎那汐塔岁主的共鸣者。在上一次狂欢节后，他宣布找到了觐见岁主的方式。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 4,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 5,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_6a6c55e6",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "在主座之下，「司铎」负责修会的各项仪式与宗教事务。而普通的神职人员被称为「教士」，他们平时研习修会的圣典，并将岁主的指引传播至拉古那各处。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 5,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 6,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_99ae7aa5",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "同时，为了维护拉古那的神圣秩序，修会下设了三个机构。它们分别是：",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 6,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 7,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_fdbfdf83",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "赦免院：拉古那的世俗司法机构，负责处理涉及家族和平民的民事与刑事案件和纠纷。类似于其他地区的法庭或裁判所。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 7,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 8,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_14420716",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "诫令院：拉古那的执法机构，也同时是拉古那对外的常备武装力量。诫令院大量运用声骸进行作战，隶属于诫令院的执法者一般被称为「诫令使」。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 8,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 9,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_13487dc8",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "忏悔院：直属于隐海修会的宗教司法机构，负责审判那些违背岁主教诲的异端，以及质疑，甚至公然背弃岁主的无信者。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 9,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 10,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    }
  ]
}